  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">エスリード建物管理株式会社</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
